    "project_name": "WFL sample plan WFL-Plan-Profile-Sheets-p21: sheet D.12",
    "description": "Alignments ORD file (FLH ORD manual 3C.4.b, the \"_ali\" file): the alignments rebuilt from sheet D.12's centerlines, station ticks and station numbers, with stationing. FLH names the ORD feature ALI_<type>_<id> (ALI_MAIN_01); the alignment here keeps the name the plan letters. Local datum: the plan view's centre at E 10,000 N 10,000, view twist 44.7252 deg (the sample sheet prints no coordinates for its linework).",
